              "content": "<p class=\"nurse-note-row\"><span class=\"nurse-note-time\">1130:</span><span class=\"nurse-note-text\">Final evaluation completed. Robert verbalizes clear understanding of the multistep development of his tumor, noting: 'My years of smoking and heavy processed meat diet provided the fuel for those mutant cells to grow into this tumor. Quitting smoking today is the best thing I can do to help my surgery succeed.' Baseline serum CEA level drawn (6.4 &mu;g/L, elevated). Follow-up scheduled for surgical admission in 4 days.</span></p>"
