          "stem": "The nurse reviews clinical actions and wound management orders for Karen on Post-Burn Day 7 as she prepares for tangential excision and autografting. For each nursing action, click to specify whether the intervention is <b>Indicated</b>, <b>Non-Essential</b>, or <b>Contraindicated</b>.",
